  nonce: 2b22  # 2b22
  message: "MECHANISM REFILED. The filed channel is CLOSED; the real defect is elsewhere and\nits damage SHIPS. Re-measured post-receiver-typing, two independent instruments.\n\nFILED (now false as a live channel): \"Go marks an external instance-method call\nis_resolved=True on an 'external'/'unresolved' dst, routing it into the ungated\nhits[0] bare-name fallback and bypassing the F3 gate.\"\n\nWHY IT IS NOT A LIVE TAINT FP CHANNEL: 0 of 125,007 taint call edges across 9\nrepos carry is_resolved=True with an external path slot. BUT THAT NULL IS\nTAUTOLOGICAL and must not be read as \"fixed\": _finalize_edge_resolution sub-step\n7 defines the predicate away post-hoc. A probe measuring after finalize is\nmeasuring finalize's own overwrite. Do NOT close this item on that zero -- that\nis the INV-nufob false-close shape.\n\nTHE REAL, SHIPPED DEFECT: confidence FOSSILIZATION.\n  - go.py:2585 emits dst `go:external:0-0:<callee>:unresolved` via Edge.create\n    with NO is_resolved argument (verified in source), so creation-time\n    derivation runs against the RESOLVED base.\n  - ir.py:933 derives confidence from is_resolved AT CREATE TIME\n    (`derive_confidence(evidence_type, is_resolved=is_resolved)`) and stamps\n    `evidence_derived`. Finalize later flips is_resolved to False and NEVER\n    re-derives.\n  - Result: 9,564 Go + 7 Python edges ship carrying `evidence_derived`\n    confidence at the RESOLVED base 0.85 instead of 0.40 (prometheus 6,847,\n    caddy 1,359, alertmanager 1,028, dnscrypt-proxy 330). rank_score mirrors it.\n  - Analyzer-stage hits: 18,496 across 4 Go repos.\n\nFIX: pass is_resolved=False at the go external emit, AND make confidence\nre-derive from finalize's verdict rather than the producer's advisory flag.\nBoth, not either -- the second is what stops the next producer re-fossilizing.\n\nDO NOT ship the filing's candidate fix (b) (\"refuse when the dst path is the\nexternal placeholder\"): it gates a branch nothing takes (escape-null replicated\n3x).\n\nDIRECTION: this moves confidence DOWNWARD, which can silently drop edges out of\nranked output. That is the DELETING direction. Ship with a per-repo before/after\nfinding count on prometheus/caddy/alertmanager/dnscrypt-proxy.\n\nRELATION TO WI-kamin: not resolved. WI-kamin measured a Go initializer-typing\nfix hijacking 118/692 moved edges (17.1%) onto the wrong in-repo symbol. Whether\nthat shares this root cause was NOT determined."  # 2b22
